    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story, hard work meets pure luck. A job offer has just been made to you after you graduated. After accepting it you were shocked by the consequences of your past actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/a394cb8fbfebd9bf49ff5334ea489336.poster.avif?t=1755017663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/a394cb8fbfebd9bf49ff5334ea489336.webm?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/a394cb8fbfebd9bf49ff5334ea489336.mp4?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > However, nothing can stop you from meeting gorgeous women and achieving success. Who knows? Maybe you can get rid of your past or spice up your future with it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/73c6ce61bcaf6ff0f036f6912e4bca49.poster.avif?t=1755017663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/73c6ce61bcaf6ff0f036f6912e4bca49.webm?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/73c6ce61bcaf6ff0f036f6912e4bca49.mp4?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/51a78778c0fa97c60891cda4b0b65e6e.poster.avif?t=1755017663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/51a78778c0fa97c60891cda4b0b65e6e.webm?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/51a78778c0fa97c60891cda4b0b65e6e.mp4?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story, hard work meets pure luck. A job offer has just been made to you after you graduated. After accepting it you were shocked by the consequences of your past actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/a394cb8fbfebd9bf49ff5334ea489336.poster.avif?t=1755017663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/a394cb8fbfebd9bf49ff5334ea489336.webm?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/a394cb8fbfebd9bf49ff5334ea489336.mp4?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > However, nothing can stop you from meeting gorgeous women and achieving success. Who knows? Maybe you can get rid of your past or spice up your future with it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/73c6ce61bcaf6ff0f036f6912e4bca49.poster.avif?t=1755017663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/73c6ce61bcaf6ff0f036f6912e4bca49.webm?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/73c6ce61bcaf6ff0f036f6912e4bca49.mp4?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/51a78778c0fa97c60891cda4b0b65e6e.poster.avif?t=1755017663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/51a78778c0fa97c60891cda4b0b65e6e.webm?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497930/extras/51a78778c0fa97c60891cda4b0b65e6e.mp4?t=1755017663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
